ong>Extended Door Dwell:<\\/strong> To facilitate safe patient transfer, we integrated adjustable infrared door sensors that keep the doors open longer when a stretcher is detected, preventing accidental closure during slow movements.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-04T12:18:04.000000Z\"}}', NULL, '2026-04-04 12:19:29', '2026-04-04 12:19:29'),
