(3389, 'componentfield', 'updated', 'App\\Models\\ComponentField', 'updated', 1697, 'App\\Models\\User', 1, '{\"attributes\":{\"value\":\"EITA-Schneider landmark new test tower stands at 90 meters and is set to become one of the tallest test tower in South East Asia.Standing at 90 meters tall, EITA-Schneider\\u2019s test tower is among the tallest in Southeast Asia. This impressive structure exemplifies EITA-Schneider\\u2019s robust dedication to R&D in elevator technology. Featuring four shafts, the tower facilitates testing, certification, and R&D for elevators in mid- and high-rise buildings.     EITA-Schneider is committed to advancing elevator technology through innovative solutions tested in their new tower, aimed at meeting global demands.\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-16T09:44:25.000000Z\"},\"old\":{\"value\":\"EITA-Schneider landmark new test tower stands at 90 meters and is set to become one of the tallest test tower in South East Asia.\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-04-13T06:09:42.000000Z\"}}', NULL, '2026-04-16 15:44:25', '2026-04-16 15:44:25'),
